Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:56:59 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] VideoPlayer: publish the presentation clock to libbluray

BD-J media time runs on the wall clock from the last start or seek.
It keeps counting through a pause, buffering and a held picture, so
disc programs that time graphics or jumps on it run ahead of the
picture on screen.
---
 cmake/modules/FindBluray.cmake                |  1 +
 .../DVDInputStreams/DVDInputStreamBluray.cpp  | 14 ++++
 .../DVDInputStreams/DVDInputStreamBluray.h    |  6 ++
 xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/VideoPlayer.cpp        | 67 ++++++++++++++++---
 xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/VideoPlayer.h          |  2 +
 .../VideoRenderers/RenderManager.cpp          |  3 +-
 .../VideoRenderers/RenderManager.h            |  3 +-
 7 files changed, 86 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/cmake/modules/FindBluray.cmake b/cmake/modules/FindBluray.cmake
